    "body": "The schema requires `release_date` when `state` is `nonstandard-released`, but `release_date`’s `oneOf` still allows `null`. As written, `{state: nonstandard-released, release_date: null}` will validate, contradicting the field meaning (and similarly for `ratification_date` in the `ratified` case). Consider tightening each `then` branch to also constrain the corresponding date field to a non-null value (e.g., `type: string` with the allowed patterns).",
