    "body": "`@parallel_enabled` is a class instance variable in a `# typed: true` file, but it’s assigned without `T.let`. Sorbet typically requires explicit typing for such ivars; consider `@parallel_enabled = T.let(nil, T.nilable(T::Boolean))` (and keep all access via the class methods).\n```suggestion\n    @parallel_enabled = T.let(nil, T.nilable(T::Boolean))\n```",
