    "body": "This RBI adds `global_options` as an instance method on `module Udb`, but the implementation is `def self.global_options` (a module singleton method). This mismatch will cause Sorbet to not recognize `Udb.global_options`; declare it as `def self.global_options` (or inside `class << self`) with the proper return type.",
