    "body": "`revdate` now calls `version.release_date`, but the generated RBI for `udb` (tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/udb@0.1.3.rbi) does not define `ExtensionVersion#release_date`. This will fail Sorbet typechecking for udb-gen; regenerate/update the RBI to include `release_date` (and ideally adjust `copyright_year` to use `release_date` for `nonstandard-released` versions so generated docs don’t still depend on the current date).",
